ges,\nlatencies, footprint, CPU, and energy;\n:Record raw artifact hashes and privacy class;\n\n|Harness / provider|\n:Run fixed cooldown and cleanup;\n:Restore impairment and fixture state;\n\n|Evidence validator|\n:Validate manifest schema, revisions,\nhashes, redaction, and artifact references;\nif (Byte, DNS, route, resource, memory, failure, drop, and cleanup gates pass?) then (yes)\nelse (no)\n  :Preserve red row and every raw reference;\n  :Do not trade safety for performance;\n  stop\nendif\n\n|Statistical reporter|\n:Build the closed parameter-family/candidate set;\n:Derive one stable comparisonGroupID\nacross all paired seeds and repetitions;\n:Bind baseline/candidate run IDs,\nsample references, and all 16 metric results;\n:Compute fixed paired bootstrap,\nexact rational coverage and integer ranks,\npractical effect, and multiplicity rule;\nif (Material regression ruled out?) then (yes)\n  if (Material improvement established?) then (yes)\n    :Classify material-improvement;\n  else (no)\n    :Classify neutral-pass;\n  endif\nelse (no)\n  :Classify red-regression or\n  red-insufficient-precision;\nendif\n\n|Independent review|\n:Review all pass, red, unavailable,\ninvalid, restricted, and excluded rows;\nif (Production authority requested?) then (yes)\n  :Require concrete reviewer/time,\n  per-metric classifications, stable group,\n  candidate count, lineage, and all safety gates;\nelse (no)\n  :Preserve provisional/non-authoritative state;\nendif\n:Accept only a new immutable baseline/config\nrevision with accountable task/ADR links;\nstop\n\n@enduml\n1:<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" contentStyleType=\"text/css\" data-diagram-type=\"ACTIVITY\" height=\"2130px\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" style=\"width:2711px;height:2130px;background:#FFFFFF;\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 2711 2130\" width=\"2711px\" zoomAndPan=\"magnify\"><?plantuml 1.2026.6?><defs/><g><g class=\"title\" data-source-line=\"3\"><